## Additional clarifications

These notes do not restrict the grant above. They state how it applies to the
non-code parts of this repository.

### 1. Data files and database rights

The data files in this repository (including `models.json` and
`categories.json`) are covered by the permission granted above. For the
avoidance of doubt, to the extent that sui generis database rights or
comparable rights subsist in these files under the laws of the European Union
or any of its member states, au2mator GmbH grants the same permissions in
respect of those rights, including the right to extract and re-utilise the
contents in whole or in substantial part.

### 2. Linked third-party images are NOT licensed here

Some records contain an `image_url` field pointing to an image hosted by the
respective hardware manufacturer, alongside the official page it was taken
from in `image_source`. Those images are the property of their respective
owners. This repository does not host, copy or redistribute them, and this
licence grants no rights in them whatsoever.

If you retrieve, store or display such an image, you do so on your own
responsibility and must satisfy yourself that you hold the necessary rights.

Manufacturer names, product names, trade marks and product designs appearing
in this data belong to their respective owners and are used for identification
purposes only.

